# Jazzer writes crash-<hash> / timeout-<hash> / slow-unit-<hash> reproducer files
# into the directory Gradle runs the tests from (the project root).
# NOTE: src/test/resources/** (Jazzer's regression inputs) is deliberately NOT ignored.
crash-*
timeout-*
slow-unit-*
oom-*
leak-*
